  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2e965f9168c2046c28c59aa4b83cc1ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: LayeredMaze
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GravityBox.Gameplay::GravityBox.Gameplay.LevelDefinition
  Id: steel-lab-layeredmaze
  DisplayIndex: 11
  DisplayName: Three dimensions
  Shape: 10
  TeachingHint: Follow each floor to its transfer opening. The round exit is on the
    lowest floor.
  Environment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82e0ce24addfe4fc89b8bbd0db998aea, type: 2}
  Prefab: {fileID: 6011215956511619992, guid: ee9677a2b9d224250902574375512e22, type: 3}
  RotationMode: 1
  InitialLocalVelocity: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  ParSeconds: 0
  Tutorial: 0
  DesignerSolution: Navigate the upper maze to its transfer opening, fall onto the
    middle floor under gravity, cross its different maze to the second opening, then
    follow the lowest maze to the flush circular exit. No teleport, lift animation
    or scripted layer transition. Shared exit assist pulls the ball through an unobstructed
    opening within 40 mm. This is deliberate gameplay assistance; the entire sphere
    must still physically clear the bore before completion.
